# Archfiend of Despair: "...loses life equal to the life that player lost this turn" - it doesn't care whether the player
# also gained life (2018-06-08 ruling). In turn 9, before the Archfiend is out (so the gain is allowed), Bot1 gives Bot2
# 3 life with Healing Salve (23) and bolts it for 3 (20; damage causes loss of life, CR 120.3a): net change 0, but 3 life
# lost. The Archfiend is then cast and its end step takes those 3: 17.

